pan="1" align="center" valign="top">1.97 &#x000b1; 0.06<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="t1fn1">&#x0002a;</xref></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">1.36 &#x000b1; 0.02</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>Data are means &#x000b1; SE unless otherwise indicated. Multivariate model includes age, education, race, BMI, physical activity, pack-years of smoking, triglycerides, drinking status (past 12&#x02013;24 months), and menopausal status (in women).</p></fn><fn id="t1fn1"><label>&#x0002a;</label><p><italic>P</italic> &#x02264; 0.001.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>